name: pocahontas
---
A sultry, dark-haired femme fatale with wet, slicked-back hair and heavy gothic makeup, dripping water, wearing ornate black leather harnesses and layered silver jewelry, intricate black ink tattoos covering her collarbones and arms. Dramatic chiaroscuro lighting, cinematic close-up, wet skin catching the light, moody atmosphere, shallow depth of field, volumetric fog, hyper-detailed, octane render, Hasselblad, 85mm lens, film grain, moody teal and crimson tones.